%% frame: UC2 basic flow, part 1: B1 to B6 with E1 to E3 (analysis)
sequenceDiagram
    actor Buyer
    participant UI as SignInUI (boundary)
    participant Ctl as SignInWithGoogleControl (control)
    participant IdP as IdentityProvider (boundary)

    Buyer->>UI: B1: signIn(returnTo)
    UI->>Ctl: B1: startSignIn()
    Ctl->>Ctl: B2: issueState()
    Ctl->>IdP: B2: authorize(state)
    Note over Buyer,IdP: B3: the buyer signs in and consents at Google, which sends the browser back
    Buyer->>UI: B4: returned(code, state)
    UI->>Ctl: B4: completeSignIn(code, state, binding)
    break consent denied (E1)
        Ctl->>UI: E1: showFailure(reason)
    end
    Ctl->>Ctl: B5: checkState(state, binding)
    break state missing, used, expired or from another browser (E2)
        Ctl->>UI: E2: showFailure(reason)
    end
    Ctl->>IdP: B6: verify(code)
    IdP-->>Ctl: verified identity, or none
    break provider unreachable or identity not verified (E3)
        Ctl->>UI: E3: showFailure(reason)
        UI-->>Buyer: sign-in page with an error, no session
    end
    Note over Ctl,IdP: B7 to B9: @fig-a-uc02-as-basic-2
